[indent][color=#666666]┃ 人报[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "诸葛瑾", "cat": "people"}]诸葛瑾[/url][/color]、[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "阚泽", "cat": "people"}]阚泽[/url][/color]、[color=#000000]吕范、[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "朱治", "cat": "people"}]朱治[/url][/color][/color]等一班文官相探。[/color][/indent]


